---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { event, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../content/site';
// DRAFT — review with the organiser before launch.
---

<Base title="Privacy note — Padel Social Vol. 2" description="How Play Padel Club handles your registration details.">
  <article class="container privacy">
    <a class="link-u" href="/">← Back to Padel Social</a>
    <h1 class="h3">Privacy note</h1>
    <p>When you register for {event.name} {event.edition}, {event.brand} collects the details you enter in the form (name, phone number, whether we should contact you on Telegram or WhatsApp, participation and playing level).</p>
    <p>We use them only to manage your registration and contact you about this event. We don’t sell them or use them for advertising. This site uses no analytics, tracking scripts or cookies.</p>
    <p>Your details are stored with our database provider (Supabase) and may be sent to our email notification service (Formspree). We keep them until the event is over and follow-up is done, then delete them.</p>
    <p>The data controller is {event.brand}. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete your data at any time. To have your data deleted, email us at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> from the address you registered with.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy { max-width: 44rem; padding-block: 5rem; display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .privacy h1 { margin-block: 1.5rem 0.5rem; }
  .privacy .link-u { justify-self: start; }
</style>
